# Guardrails for crates/
#
# All backend capability crates live here. To add a new one:
#
# 1. Run `cargo init crates/riff-<name>`
# 2. Add the workspace-relative path to the `members` list in root `Cargo.toml`.
# 3. Add any path-dependency overrides needed in `tests/Cargo.toml`.
#
# The `tests` crate (integration tests) intentionally stays at the workspace root.
#
# A CI check (ci/no-solo-crate.sh) rejects workspace crates that live outside
# this directory or the workspace root, so ad-hoc top-level crate dirs will
# fail the build.
